inimod (1.0.3) unstable; urgency=medium

  * The Windows executable carries version resource 1.0.3.0, generated from
    src/IniMod.rc; 1.0.2 still embedded 1.0.0.0.
  * The MSI authors that file version, so a major upgrade from 1.0.1 or 1.0.2
    replaces inimod.exe and keeps the machine PATH entry.
  * No change to the Debian command or its installed files.

